# AWS Deploy

- Use `scripts/aws-deploy.sh`, `aws-app-url.sh`, `aws-idle.sh`, `aws-wake.sh` — do not freestyle destructive terraform.
- After push: wait ECS stable; verify `/health`, `/api/meta`, UI route HTTP 200.
- Prefer documented region/stack in `docs/AWS_DEPLOYMENT.md` / `AWS_COST.md`.
- Never force-push, hard-reset, or tear down prod resources unless the user explicitly asks.
- Idle non-prod when appropriate; note URL changes if ALB/EIP shifts.
